@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "호출자" as Caller

rectangle "explainExecution(request)" as API {
  component "정본 .ghost.md\n소스 재컴파일" as C
  component "출력 설명 +\n완료된 스캔 snapshot\n+ proof/snapshot join" as J
  component "장치 identity와\n레코드 검사" as D
}

rectangle "execution-evidence-result-v1" as R {
  card "requested, safe,\nauthored" as R1
  card "장치 상태" as R2
}

Caller --> C : source, runId, outputId
Caller --> J : 승인된 스캔 결과
Caller --> D : expectedDevice,\ndeviceEvidence
C --> J
J --> R1
D --> R2

note right of API : 새 evaluator 없음, 장치 접속 없음,\n디스크에서 import 읽지 않음
@enduml
